# A comment in place (scenes/about.seed.ts writes the note into a scratch outline): the compost heap in the reader,
# the words its two comment threads are on marked where they are drawn, and each thread beside its words. The
# first is opened whole (its comment, the answer, its own Reply and Resolve); the second is folded to its first
# words. Draw it wide (`--size 1760x900 --at 0.5`) and the threads are in the margin; narrower, they are under their parts.
bar.open scope=search query="Compost heap"
bar.pick n=1
thread.toggle
